{"text": " You wake up in 1647 in a farming town in Massachusetts. There's frost on the window and the cows need milking before breakfast. Did you know that one of America's first school laws begins by blaming the devil? It says it's a chief project of that old deluder, Satan, to keep men from the knowledge of the scriptures. So what is school to you now? A way to read God's word with your own eyes. Five years earlier, a law told parents and masters to teach their children to read. Lots of them didn't bother. So now, any town with 50 households has to hire someone to teach reading and writing. 100 households? A grammar school, too, or the town pays a fine. You learn your letters between the chores and on Sunday, you hear why they matter. All over Protestant Europe, churches want people reading, but a church can only ask. In the next century, a king will order it and he'll ban one thing every kid on earth looks forward to.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.32, "text": " You wake up in 1647 in a farming town in Massachusetts.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 3165, 14060, 294, 257, 16557, 3954, 294, 19979, 13, 50570], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1308145444901263, "compression_ratio": 1.5241379310344827, "no_speech_prob": 0.009767156094312668, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.7506889700889587}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9958032965660095}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.48, "probability": 0.9994862079620361}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.48, "end": 0.6, "probability": 0.9957876801490784}, {"word": " 1647", "start": 0.6, "end": 1.7, "probability": 0.98316890001297}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.7, "end": 1.98, "probability": 0.920173168182373}, {"word": " a", "start": 1.98, "end": 2.06, "probability": 0.9987542629241943}, {"word": " farming", "start": 2.06, "end": 2.36, "probability": 0.9630435109138489}, {"word": " town", "start": 2.36, "end": 2.62, "p